OL,3,GNEWSAMinister says school uniform porn
OL,4,Aban a 'blunt tool'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ban on pornography featuring school
OL,7,Funiforms, campaigned for by a pupils at
OL,8,Fan Oxfordshire school, would be a
OL,9,F"blunt tool", a government minister has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe campaign was started by a group of
OL,13,Fteenage girls from The Cooper School in
OL,14,FBicester who said uniforms have been
OL,15,F"tarnished... and warped by
OL,16,Fsexualisation".
OL,18,FTheir petition garnered more than
OL,19,F71,000 signatures online.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
